[5249]="700698B1\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[5250]="7002E76D\n1\tSpeak to Gredlan Mugwort\tSpeak to Gredlan Mugwort.\n",
[5251]="700454F1\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you can select any type of available festival tokens.\n",
[5252]="70003249\n1\tBring tusk-rings to Gailthin\tGailthin is in the dwarf-city of Gondamon, in the low-lands of Ered Luin. Golhador has asked you to show the tusk-rings to emissary Gailthin.\n",
[5253]="70037077\n1\tDefeat brigands at their camp near Oserley\tBrigands can be found at their camp, west of Oserley in the Broadacres of Rohan. You should defeat the brigands who have been thieving from the people of Oserley.\n2\tDefeat brigands at their camp near Oserley (total: 8)\tBrigands can be found at their camp, west of Oserley in the Broadacres of Rohan. You should defeat the brigands who have been thieving from the people of Oserley.\n",
[5254]="700442F2\n1\tPut out fires in the fields (total: 4)\tFires can be found in the fields near Parth Lisc. You should put out fires in the fields.\n2\tRecover supplies from Parth Lisc (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found around the farm houses in Parth Lisc. Now that the fires are dealt with, you should recover any supplies from the farm.\n3\tBring the supplies for Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[5255]="7006B609\n1\tDefeat crocodiles (total: 4)\030Defeat zizani (total: 6)\tSûlmur has offered you a reward for defeating crocodiles and zizani, what the locals call Neekers, in the papyrus fields at Mehêtur in Ambarûl.\n2\tTalk to Sûlmur\tYou have defeated crocodiles and zizani in the papyrus fields. You should return to Sûlmur north-east of the fields.\n",
[5256]="7002F994\n1\tFarmers can be found all around the Mead Hall of Faldham, at their individual farmsteads. Osin has asked you to seek the various farmers around Faldham and to lend them what aid you can.\t\n2\tReturn to Osin in Faldham\tOsin prepares outside the Mead Hall at the centre of Faldham. The farmer's troubles have been put to rest, and Osin may now focus on his own problems.\n",
[5257]="70009E7B\n1\tDefeat Snowreap Sapper (total: 5)\030Defeat Snowreap Guard (total: 5)\tThere are Snowreap-guards and sappers at Grothum, north of Ost Ringdyr. Lieutenant Ingi wishes to cull the Snowreap goblins from the Ettenmoors and weaken the forces which Angmar can bring to bear against the Free Peoples.\n2\tTalk to Lieutenant Ingi\tIngi is at Ost Ringdyr, south of Grothum. With the goblins dispatched, the time has come to return to Ingi.\n",
[5258]="70028CAE\n1\tDefeat Warg-riders (total: 2)\030Defeat pack-leaders (total: 5)\tWarg pack-leaders and goblin Warg-riders can be found near the Warg-warrens, east of Garrun's camp. Garrun asked you to defeat the pack-leaders and Warg-riders among the Warg-warrens.\n2\tTalk to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun is at his camp, west of the Warg-warrens. You should return to Garrun with tidings of your success.\n",
